Handa na ang Nginx-RTMP setup sa [nginx-rtmp/](/workspace/nginx-rtmp). Tumatanggap ito ng publish sa `rtmp://localhost:1935/live/<key>` at nagsi-serve ng HLS sa `http://localhost:8081/hls/<key>.m3u8`.


<render_file file_path="/workspace/artifacts/nginx-rtmp.zip" />


## Start


```bash
cd nginx-rtmp
docker compose up -d
curl http://localhost:8081/
```


Image: `tiangolo/nginx-rtmp` (nginx 1.23.2 + nginx-rtmp-module). Fragment ay 2s, playlist ~10s, kaya **keyframe interval = 2 segundo**.


## ffmpeg test stream


Stream key `test`:


```bash
ffmpeg -re \
  -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=size=1280x720:rate=30" \
  -f lavfi -i "sine=frequency=440:sample_rate=48000" \
  -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast -tune zerolatency \
  -profile:v baseline -pix_fmt yuv420p \
  -g 60 -keyint_min 60 -sc_threshold 0 -bf 0 \
  -b:v 2500k -maxrate 2500k -bufsize 5000k \
  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 48000 -ac 2 \
  -f flv rtmp://localhost:1935/live/test
```


O `./scripts/push-test.sh test`. Pagkalipas ng ~6s:


```bash
ffplay http://localhost:8081/hls/test.m3u8
```


## OBS


| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Service | Custom |
| Server | `rtmp://localhost:1935/live` |
| Stream Key | `test` |
| Keyframe interval | 2 seconds |


Playback: `http://localhost:8081/hls/test.m3u8`


Kailangan ng stream key. Ang huling bahagi ng RTMP URL ang pangalan ng `.m3u8` (`hls_nested off`, kaya hindi `/hls/<key>/index.m3u8`).


`allow publish all` ito — huwag i-expose ang port 1935 sa public internet nang walang firewall o publish secret. Walang Docker sa environment na ito, kaya hindi ko na-boot ang container; i-run ang compose sa machine na may Docker.


